# Magnitude-LEONES — Personal AI Assistant

## Objective

Use Magnitude as a reference integration for the **Personal AI Assistant** profile.

LEONES provides preflight, installation, governance, validation and benchmarking. Magnitude provides the local agent and its execution environment.

## Relevant capabilities

Magnitude integrates a local agent and local models, hardware profiling, model recommendation, download/configuration, local execution, skills and OpenAI-compatible endpoints. Its local-first approach is relevant to privacy and offline operation.

## Installation

```bash
npm install -g @magnitudedev/cli
```

Then, in the assistant project:

```bash
magnitude
```

## LEONES governance

Skills must be catalogued by origin, version/ref, permissions, file access, network access and tools. Risky skills should not be installed automatically.

Keep **observed**, **recommended/configured**, **estimated** and **measured** evidence separate.

**Classification:** reference integration for a Personal AI Assistant.